{
  "isLocked": false,
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Introduction",
      "content": {
        "json": "# AVD errors\r\nRecorded errors only: **what the error says, who it affected, how often it occurred, and when it happened**. Messages and codes are shown as recorded, without suggested solutions or inferred causes.\r\n\r\nSelect the workspace, time window, host pool/resource, and users. An optional exact activity ID narrows all panels. All times are UTC.\r\n\r\nOnly `WVDErrors` records are shown. Counts are error records, not unique failures. Unknown users remain visible under All users. Missing diagnostics or retention can hide errors; no data does not prove there were no errors. Tables display up to 10,000 rows, subject to query-service limits."
      },
      "type": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace and time",
      "content": {
        "style": "pills",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "id": "ab724af8-29c6-40c3-8db0-2b388dbd5287",
            "typeSettings": {
              "showDefault": false,
              "resourceTypeFilter": {
                "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces": true
              },
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::1"
              ]
            },
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "name": "Workspace",
            "value": "",
            "label": "Log Analytics workspace"
          },
          {
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "id": "44df0f9b-3822-490c-b973-15c7f64d849e",
            "label": "Observation window (UTC)",
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            },
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 14400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            }
          }
        ],
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0"
      },
      "type": 9
    },
    {
      "name": "Error filters",
      "content": {
        "style": "pills",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "label": "Host pool / resource",
            "isRequired": true,
            "id": "bdac7613-8fde-46fb-9d6f-6a9c45e482a8",
            "quote": "'",
            "multiSelect": true,
            "value": [
              "All"
            ],
            "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "queryType": 0,
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "HostPool",
            "type": 2,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "query": "union (print value=\"All\", label=\"All resources / host pools\"),\r\n(\r\n    union isfuzzy=true\r\n        (datatable(TimeGenerated:datetime, _ResourceId:string)[]), WVDErrors\r\n    | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\r\n    | extend value=tolower(_ResourceId)\r\n    | where isnotempty(value)\r\n    | distinct value\r\n    | project value, label=strcat(coalesce(extract(@\"(?i)/hostpools/([^/]+)\", 1, value), value), \" | \", value)\r\n)\r\n| order by label asc"
          },
          {
            "label": "Affected users",
            "isRequired": true,
            "id": "cf43ef35-2c39-4d54-83d9-2ba48eab8b43",
            "quote": "'",
            "multiSelect": true,
            "value": [
              "All"
            ],
            "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "queryType": 0,
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Users",
            "type": 2,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "query": "let WindowStart = {TimeRange:start};\r\nlet WindowEnd = {TimeRange:end};\r\nlet ErrorsInPool =\r\n    union isfuzzy=true\r\n        (datatable(TimeGenerated:datetime, _ResourceId:string,\r\n            CorrelationId:string, UserName:string, Code:long, CodeSymbolic:string,\r\n            Message:string, ServiceError:bool, Source:string, Operation:string,\r\n            ActivityType:string)[]),\r\n        WVDErrors\r\n    | where TimeGenerated between (WindowStart .. WindowEnd)\r\n    | extend ResourceId=tolower(_ResourceId)\r\n    | where 'All' in ({HostPool}) or ResourceId in~ ({HostPool})\r\n    | project TimeGenerated, ResourceId,\r\n        HostPool=extract(@\"(?i)/hostpools/([^/]+)\", 1, ResourceId),\r\n        CorrelationId, UserName, Code, CodeSymbolic, Message,\r\n        ServiceError, Source, Operation, ActivityType;\r\nunion (print value=\"All\", label=\"All users (including unknown users)\"),\r\n(ErrorsInPool | where isnotempty(UserName) | distinct value=tolower(UserName) | project value, label=value)\r\n| order by label asc"
          },
          {
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "",
            "id": "6ba3d80c-7867-43cb-a25e-fe4cb3ea6b55",
            "name": "CorrelationId",
            "type": 1,
            "label": "Error activity ID (optional exact match)",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0"
          }
        ],
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0"
      },
      "type": 9
    },
    {
      "name": "Error record counts",
      "content": {
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "size": 0,
        "showRefreshButton": true,
        "query": "let WindowStart = {TimeRange:start};\r\nlet WindowEnd = {TimeRange:end};\r\nlet ErrorsInPool =\r\n    union isfuzzy=true\r\n        (datatable(TimeGenerated:datetime, _ResourceId:string,\r\n            CorrelationId:string, UserName:string, Code:long, CodeSymbolic:string,\r\n            Message:string, ServiceError:bool, Source:string, Operation:string,\r\n            ActivityType:string)[]),\r\n        WVDErrors\r\n    | where TimeGenerated between (WindowStart .. WindowEnd)\r\n    | extend ResourceId=tolower(_ResourceId)\r\n    | where 'All' in ({HostPool}) or ResourceId in~ ({HostPool})\r\n    | project TimeGenerated, ResourceId,\r\n        HostPool=extract(@\"(?i)/hostpools/([^/]+)\", 1, ResourceId),\r\n        CorrelationId, UserName, Code, CodeSymbolic, Message,\r\n        ServiceError, Source, Operation, ActivityType;\r\nlet FocusId = trim(@\"\\s+\", base64_decode_tostring('{CorrelationId:base64}'));\r\nlet Errors =\r\n    ErrorsInPool\r\n    | where 'All' in ({Users}) or UserName in~ ({Users})\r\n    | where isempty(FocusId) or CorrelationId =~ FocusId;\r\nErrors\r\n| summarize ErrorRecords=count(), FirstErrorUTC=min(TimeGenerated), LastErrorUTC=max(TimeGenerated),\r\n    UnknownUserRecords=countif(isempty(UserName))\r\n| extend DataStatus=iff(ErrorRecords == 0,\r\n    \"No recorded errors in selected scope; missing telemetry is possible.\",\r\n    \"Recorded errors in selected scope; counts are records, not unique failures.\")",
        "exportToExcelOptions": "visible",
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        },
        "title": "Error record counts",
        "visualization": "table",
        "queryType": 0,
        "noDataMessage": "No recorded errors match this scope. Missing diagnostics or retention can also produce no data; this is not proof of no errors. Query warnings/errors remain relevant.",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "showAnalytics": true,
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "showExportToExcel": true,
        "description": "Total recorded errors and first/last occurrence in the selected scope."
      },
      "type": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "Error timeline - exact messages",
      "content": {
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "size": 0,
        "showRefreshButton": true,
        "query": "let WindowStart = {TimeRange:start};\r\nlet WindowEnd = {TimeRange:end};\r\nlet ErrorsInPool =\r\n    union isfuzzy=true\r\n        (datatable(TimeGenerated:datetime, _ResourceId:string,\r\n            CorrelationId:string, UserName:string, Code:long, CodeSymbolic:string,\r\n            Message:string, ServiceError:bool, Source:string, Operation:string,\r\n            ActivityType:string)[]),\r\n        WVDErrors\r\n    | where TimeGenerated between (WindowStart .. WindowEnd)\r\n    | extend ResourceId=tolower(_ResourceId)\r\n    | where 'All' in ({HostPool}) or ResourceId in~ ({HostPool})\r\n    | project TimeGenerated, ResourceId,\r\n        HostPool=extract(@\"(?i)/hostpools/([^/]+)\", 1, ResourceId),\r\n        CorrelationId, UserName, Code, CodeSymbolic, Message,\r\n        ServiceError, Source, Operation, ActivityType;\r\nlet FocusId = trim(@\"\\s+\", base64_decode_tostring('{CorrelationId:base64}'));\r\nlet Errors =\r\n    ErrorsInPool\r\n    | where 'All' in ({Users}) or UserName in~ ({Users})\r\n    | where isempty(FocusId) or CorrelationId =~ FocusId;\r\nErrors\r\n| project TimeUTC=TimeGenerated, UserName, Code, CodeSymbolic, Message,\r\n    Source, Operation, ActivityType, ServiceError, HostPool, ResourceId, CorrelationId\r\n| order by TimeUTC asc, ResourceId asc, CorrelationId asc",
        "exportToExcelOptions": "visible",
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        },
        "title": "Error timeline - exact messages",
        "visualization": "table",
        "queryType": 0,
        "noDataMessage": "No recorded errors match this scope. Missing diagnostics or retention can also produce no data; this is not proof of no errors. Query warnings/errors remain relevant.",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "showAnalytics": true,
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "showExportToExcel": true,
        "description": "One row per recorded error in UTC chronological order. Original messages and codes are not rewritten."
      },
      "type": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "Error summary",
      "content": {
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "size": 0,
        "showRefreshButton": true,
        "query": "let WindowStart = {TimeRange:start};\r\nlet WindowEnd = {TimeRange:end};\r\nlet ErrorsInPool =\r\n    union isfuzzy=true\r\n        (datatable(TimeGenerated:datetime, _ResourceId:string,\r\n            CorrelationId:string, UserName:string, Code:long, CodeSymbolic:string,\r\n            Message:string, ServiceError:bool, Source:string, Operation:string,\r\n            ActivityType:string)[]),\r\n        WVDErrors\r\n    | where TimeGenerated between (WindowStart .. WindowEnd)\r\n    | extend ResourceId=tolower(_ResourceId)\r\n    | where 'All' in ({HostPool}) or ResourceId in~ ({HostPool})\r\n    | project TimeGenerated, ResourceId,\r\n        HostPool=extract(@\"(?i)/hostpools/([^/]+)\", 1, ResourceId),\r\n        CorrelationId, UserName, Code, CodeSymbolic, Message,\r\n        ServiceError, Source, Operation, ActivityType;\r\nlet FocusId = trim(@\"\\s+\", base64_decode_tostring('{CorrelationId:base64}'));\r\nlet Errors =\r\n    ErrorsInPool\r\n    | where 'All' in ({Users}) or UserName in~ ({Users})\r\n    | where isempty(FocusId) or CorrelationId =~ FocusId;\r\nErrors\r\n| summarize ErrorRecords=count(), FirstSeenUTC=min(TimeGenerated), LastSeenUTC=max(TimeGenerated),\r\n    UnknownUserRecords=countif(isempty(UserName))\r\n    by HostPool, ResourceId, UserName, Code, CodeSymbolic, Message, Source, Operation,\r\n        ActivityType, ServiceError\r\n| order by ErrorRecords desc, LastSeenUTC desc",
        "exportToExcelOptions": "visible",
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        },
        "title": "Error summary",
        "visualization": "table",
        "queryType": 0,
        "noDataMessage": "No recorded errors match this scope. Missing diagnostics or retention can also produce no data; this is not proof of no errors. Query warnings/errors remain relevant.",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "showAnalytics": true,
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "showExportToExcel": true,
        "description": "Exact error signatures by user and resource, with occurrence counts and first/last timestamps."
      },
      "type": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "Errors over time",
      "content": {
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "size": 0,
        "showRefreshButton": true,
        "query": "let WindowStart = {TimeRange:start};\r\nlet WindowEnd = {TimeRange:end};\r\nlet ErrorsInPool =\r\n    union isfuzzy=true\r\n        (datatable(TimeGenerated:datetime, _ResourceId:string,\r\n            CorrelationId:string, UserName:string, Code:long, CodeSymbolic:string,\r\n            Message:string, ServiceError:bool, Source:string, Operation:string,\r\n            ActivityType:string)[]),\r\n        WVDErrors\r\n    | where TimeGenerated between (WindowStart .. WindowEnd)\r\n    | extend ResourceId=tolower(_ResourceId)\r\n    | where 'All' in ({HostPool}) or ResourceId in~ ({HostPool})\r\n    | project TimeGenerated, ResourceId,\r\n        HostPool=extract(@\"(?i)/hostpools/([^/]+)\", 1, ResourceId),\r\n        CorrelationId, UserName, Code, CodeSymbolic, Message,\r\n        ServiceError, Source, Operation, ActivityType;\r\nlet FocusId = trim(@\"\\s+\", base64_decode_tostring('{CorrelationId:base64}'));\r\nlet Errors =\r\n    ErrorsInPool\r\n    | where 'All' in ({Users}) or UserName in~ ({Users})\r\n    | where isempty(FocusId) or CorrelationId =~ FocusId;\r\nErrors\r\n| summarize ErrorRecords=count() by TimeUTC=bin(TimeGenerated, 15m)\r\n| order by TimeUTC asc",
        "exportToExcelOptions": "visible",
        "title": "Errors over time",
        "visualization": "timechart",
        "queryType": 0,
        "noDataMessage": "No recorded errors match this scope. Missing diagnostics or retention can also produce no data; this is not proof of no errors. Query warnings/errors remain relevant.",
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "showAnalytics": true,
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Workspace}"
        ],
        "showExportToExcel": true,
        "description": "Recorded error counts in 15-minute UTC buckets. Missing buckets are not filled with zero."
      },
      "type": 3
    }
  ],
  "fallbackResourceIds": [],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json",
  "version": "Notebook/1.0"
}
